caption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499386662096896906538.png/1mAUDSnETlFOvyqKva_q-HSaaAaBepvmx5w1qsecNao\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499388910374912238769.png/Fs2pT5lMdXXk-Xg69U6zKLrjpIaBwOhPuZ51wrmedcI\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489498715053101056921036.png/Rd_ibbyxQY4LyERcE2cc6qiQ_lzgtnhdIQGANyEBgDc\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499391167172608640579.png/vuGA92H-o0XlntMD4jvinWNfXR40IdsC7ZRcku2UXJI\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499393335758848709653.png/NL6LsVuuxpZKn87HHgabh-wXIcv4c-GZu2Am6rtgJuo\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499395214938112721498.png/dCktlnulLApuvxsn3fJQ7B9pxosvQqym6wLKMusCyjI\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499397341581312283671.png/W2p3KnIuMxWOFmYQadrmDB0XPN3NBPhyZv9DqGb_Q6g\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210707/489499399560499200235960.png/XuYXIsfMrE7TDNv6ngagLH6lQAivzx-uANP7FADT-xQ\"/><figcaption>逐格睇巨大隕石衝擊台灣（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>批川普關稅重拳「錯上加錯」！美前財長：史上最大自傷</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T11:39:05.204175+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1185,"images":22,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}